  "wikitext": "[[File:Icy Gift.png|200px|left|Icy Gift]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 17\n |holly = 10\n |time = 10m\n |source = {{Infoicon|giftwrappings|bigger|link=Gift Wrapping Station}}\n |xp = 98\n |dia = 10\n}}\n'''Icy Gift''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 20. It's a special item used only for the Christmas 2025 event.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Starry Gift'''===\n[[File:Gift Wrapping Station.png|150px|left|Gift Wrapping Station]]\nStarry gift are made in the [[Gift Wrapping Station]].\n\nTo make a icy gift in 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Pumpkin.png |75px|Pumpkin|link=Pumpkin]]\n|[[File:Bacon.png|75px|Bacon|link=Bacon]]\n|[[File:Raspberry Muffin.png|75px|Raspberry muffin|link=Raspberry Muffin]]\n|-\n|'''x5'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 10 minutes to make a gift. Each gift gives players 98 [[experience]] points.\n\nAdditionally, icy gift is used to make the following [[products]]:\n{{Item Usage|Icy Gift\n|Red Gift|1|80\n}}\n\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 gifts per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat. Each candy used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 [[Holly]]s, 11 hollys in a 1-star, 14 hollys in a 2-star, and 20 hollys in a 3-star.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|es = Regalo helado\n}}\n[[Category:Gift Wrapping Station Products]]\n[[Category:Pumpkin Products]]\n[[Category:Bacon Products]]\n[[Category:Raspberry Muffin Products]]",
